#undef NDEBUG
// Review HB: Declare keyed by typed columns of a CSV upload (its log shape,
// DataFrame and LazyFrame) and Declare conformance keyed by typed XES
// columns (DataFrame and LazyFrame).
//
// - A CSV upload's Declare keyed by a column read_csv types as numbers,
//   booleans, dates or objects, or with gaps: the model pm4py answers
//   through its rules frame on format_dataframe's typed cells (the log
//   shape's event log holds the same objects), the Polars copy's column
//   checks (a column of numbers is no String; read_csv's gaps are nulls),
//   and on the log shape the whole mine failing on a conformance error.
// - The conformance against that typed model: each case's deviations named
//   by the model's typed keys, subscript and unpack TypeErrors of collapsed
//   one-element keys, NaN and NaT unequal to themselves; on the Polars
//   frame the deviations named by str() of the pandas objects.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-hb: tc/mkhb.py, ct/dcx.py). A case whose pm4py error
// names hash-seed dependent operands compares the error's class.
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_hb_tests <minera_server>

